Subject: [PATCH 3/5] [Perf][ROCm] RDNA4 FP8 block-scale FlyDSL GEMM (upstream
 #56005)

Version-locked to VLLM_REF=v0.30.0 (cherry-picked 2026-09-24; applies
cleanly, no porting). Upstream PR #56005 (open): 1.786x geomean vs Triton
(min 1.257x, 18/18 shapes) on Radeon AI PRO R9700 with Qwen3.8-27B-FP8
shapes, validated against FlyDSL main@65e5d8e (contained in flydsl
0.3.4.1, the PyPI release used by the image). RDNA4Fp8BlockScaledMMKernel
is registered before the Aiter/Triton block-FP8 kernels, so it is
auto-selected on gfx120x for OCP-FP8 1x128/128x128 block-scaled BF16
layers when flydsl is importable.
